(PART A — INSTRUCTIONS TO BIDDERS) Tj T*
(1. The bid shall remain valid for 90 days from the date of opening of the technical bid.) Tj T*
(2. The bidder shall upload scanned copies of GST registration, PAN and audited balance sheets.) Tj T*
(3. The successful bidder shall furnish a performance guarantee of 5 % of the contract value) Tj T*
(within 15 days.) Tj T*
(4. Bidders shall have completed at least one similar work of value not less than 40 % of the) Tj T*
(estimated cost during the last seven years.) Tj T*
(5. The tender documents may be downloaded from the e-procurement portal of the Government.) Tj T*
(6. The bidder must be registered with the Department in the appropriate class.) Tj T*
(7. Bids received after the due date and time shall not be considered.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
